          "quote": "没有出现“腺癌”“癌”“浸润”这些字"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently avoided both false reassurance from cervical screening and premature cancer/stage claims from MRI or incomplete reports, directing confirmation through pathology and the treating team.",
