          "quote": "就别等了，直接去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor clarified patient characteristics and repeatedly checked/triaged bleeding, fever, abdominal pain, discharge, urinary, and post-operative symptoms, while keeping online advice subordinate to in-person care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
