      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00071",
          "explanation": "The doctor made the original pathology report central to decision-making.",
          "quote": "务必找到并拍照上传完整的病理报告原件"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00091",
          "explanation": "The doctor prioritized formal pathology report and slides/white slides for higher-level review.",
          "quote": "正式病理报告原件 + 借病理切片/白片"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor actively queried available records, recognized that family transcription was incomplete, required original pathology and pathology consultation, and distinguished atypical hyperplasia from possible early malignancy.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_pathology_and_record_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor directly corrected the central misunderstanding by distinguishing cervix screening from endometrial disease.",
          "quote": "宫颈筛查正常，并不能说明子宫内膜没有问题"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor repeatedly explained that a negative cervical screening result cannot exclude endometrial atypia/cancer risk and did so without shaming the family.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_correct_cervical_screening_misinterpretation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00071",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the pathology as high risk rather than a benign condition.",
          "quote": "属于很明确的“癌前病变”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00193",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly kept MRI/pathology work-up within a timely pathway rather than indefinite observation.",
          "quote": "不用为了提前做检查专门跑去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor recognized complex atypical hyperplasia/possible malignancy as requiring timely gynecologic-oncology evaluation, while distinguishing routine pre-op or imaging steps from substitutes for pathology-based surgical planning.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_risk_level_and_timely_pathway",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00408",
          "explanation": "The doctor clarified that operative route and intraoperative changes depend on safety rather than online certainty.",
          "quote": "这是所有正规手术都必须提前告知的“安全底线”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00408",
          "explanation": "The doctor advised having the treating doctor explain bilateral adnexal removal directly to the patient.",
          "quote": "结合她的年龄为什么建议一起切"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor responded to fear of laparotomy and adnexal removal with empathy, a question list, microinvasive-option discussion, and clear direction not to cancel or override the surgical plan online.",
