          "quote": "禁食禁水：这是麻醉安全的底线"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00431",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave concrete perioperative preparation items consistent with hospital workflow.",
          "quote": "备皮和肠道准备"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor discussed pre-op checks and perioperative safety measures, did not invent blocking comorbidities, and kept fatty liver/breast-nodule history as information for anesthesia/surgical assessment rather than a reason to avoid necessary care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_preoperative_safety_and_comorbid_context",
